cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clustering-Based PSO for Global MPPT of Partially Shaded PV Strings"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python implementation and experimental evidence for PSOMbest
  (Twumasi et al., 2024) and the B1/B2 frozen-clustering and coverage-based
  PSO variants for global maximum power point tracking in partially shaded
  photovoltaic strings.
authors:
  - name: "Archangel15"
    website: "https://github.com/Archangel15"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Archangel15/pso-mppt-clustering"
keywords:
  - particle swarm optimization
  - maximum power point tracking
  - photovoltaic
  - partial shading
  - clustering
  - PSOMbest
  - reproducibility
